Revision history for Alien-nghttp3

0.01  2026-10-02
    - Initial release.
    - Use a system libnghttp3 1.18.0 or newer when available.
    - Include nghttp3 1.18.0 source for the fallback build.
    - Build the fallback without downloading nghttp3 from the network.
    - Build only libnghttp3 for the fallback.
    - Keep the distribution independent of QUIC implementations, TLS,
      event loops, and HTTP frameworks.
    - Support Perl 5.20 and newer.
    - Require Alien::Build 2.84 or newer.
    - Test the native library with a real XS compile and link test.
